===== /app/treenote/floor.txt =====
Busy-floor note: some shifts invoke steep with an exclusive hold so the mill never shares the floor. The hold helper lives under /app/holdbay. Desk stalls that recover overnight often get blamed on overlap, not on a finished JSON object.
===== /app/snapvat/NOTE.txt =====
Wall stamp for mill-local calendar sketches. Not the urn day field.
===== /app/holdbay/HOLD.txt =====
Optional exclusive mill hold. Not on the pour/steep path unless wired in.
